Error [jet.BlockAfterCall]: Trailing blocks are only valid on direct calls
  --> tests/ui/trailing_block_on_index.jet:3:11
    |
  3 |     xs[0] {
    |           ^
 Why: A bare `{ }` here is not a call argument; code arguments use `fn() { … }` inside a call's parentheses
 Fix: Write `callee(fn() { … })` on a call
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0335
